Notebook[{Cell["MagneticTB 入门", "Title"], Cell["要构造紧束缚模型，需要给出晶格、原子位置、对称操作和局域轨道。有了这些输入，MagneticTB 就可以生成等价原子，求出对称性允许的跃迁。下面以石墨烯为例，介绍如何构造 Hamiltonian 并画出能带。", "Text"], Cell["安装、更新、卸载与加载", "Section"], Cell["安装前需要取得 MagneticTB 的 .paclet 文件，也可以从源码构建。下面使用本地文件安装，不会从网上自动下载。", "Text"], Cell["安装", "Subsection"], Cell[TextData[{ButtonBox["MagneticTB 帮助主页", BaseStyle -> "Link", ButtonData -> "paclet:MagneticTB/guide/MagneticTB"]}], "Text"], Cell["取得 .paclet 文件后，在 Mathematica 中运行下面的命令，其中路径和文件名要换成实际文件：", "Text"], Cell[BoxData["PacletInstall[\"/absolute/path/MagneticTB-2.x.y.paclet\"]"], "Input"], Cell["安装后，请完全退出 Mathematica 再重新打开，然后加载 MagneticTB 或打开帮助文档。这样也可以清除先前版本在内核中留下的定义。", "Text"], Cell["更新", "Subsection"], Cell[TextData[{ButtonBox["MagneticTB 帮助主页", BaseStyle -> "Link", ButtonData -> "paclet:MagneticTB/guide/MagneticTB"]}], "Text"], Cell["更新时，按同样的方法安装新的 .paclet 文件，再退出并重新打开 Mathematica。如果出现 PacletInstall::samevers，说明相同版本已经安装；要换成同版本的另一个文件，需要先卸载该版本，再重新安装。", "Text"], Cell[BoxData["PacletInstall[\"/absolute/path/MagneticTB-2.x.y.paclet\"]"], "Input"], Cell["卸载或重装同一版本", "Subsection"], Cell[TextData[{ButtonBox["MagneticTB 帮助主页", BaseStyle -> "Link", ButtonData -> "paclet:MagneticTB/guide/MagneticTB"]}], "Text"], Cell["如果不再使用 MagneticTB，可以运行下面的命令卸载，再退出并重新打开 Mathematica：", "Text"], Cell[BoxData["PacletUninstall[\"MagneticTB\"]"], "Input"], Cell["加载并打开帮助文档", "Subsection"], Cell[TextData[{ButtonBox["MagneticTB 帮助主页", BaseStyle -> "Link", ButtonData -> "paclet:MagneticTB/guide/MagneticTB"]}], "Text"], Cell["重新打开 Mathematica 后，使用 Needs 加载程序包。在帮助中心搜索 MagneticTB，或运行下面的命令，都可以打开帮助主页。1.0 版函数使用 MagneticTBOld` 加载，需要与 2.0 版分别在不同内核中使用。", "Text"], Cell[BoxData["Needs[\"MagneticTB`\"]"], "Input"], Cell[BoxData["SystemOpen[\"paclet:MagneticTB/guide/MagneticTB\"]"], "Input"], Cell["五类物理输入", "Section"], Cell["有了对称操作，就可以使用 init 设置晶格、原子位置和基函数。其中 lattice 的三行分别是三个晶格基矢，lattpar 给出晶格参数；wyckoffposition 给出各个不等价 Wyckoff 位置的代表原子及磁矩；symminformation 是对称操作，basisFunctions 按相同顺序列出各位置的局域轨道。", "Text"], Cell["石墨烯的两个碳原子是对称等价的，只需输入 {1/3,2/3,0}，程序就会生成另一个位置 {2/3,1/3,0}。每个碳原子保留一个 pz 轨道，晶格参数 c 用来分隔周期重复的石墨烯层。", "Text"], Cell[BoxData[GridBox[{{Cell["      ", "TableRowIcon"], "lattice", Cell["长度", "TableText"], Cell["按行存储三条原胞基矢。wyckoffposition 中的坐标是相对于该基的分数坐标。", "TableText"]}, {Cell["      ", "TableRowIcon"], "lattpar", Cell["长度", "TableText"], Cell["为每个符号晶格常数给出数值。MagneticTB 不强制使用埃作为单位；所有长度必须采用一致单位。", "TableText"]}, {Cell["      ", "TableRowIcon"], "wyckoffposition", Cell["分数坐标与磁矩", "TableText"], Cell["外层列表枚举不等价 Wyckoff 轨道。每个条目为 {种子位置, 磁矩}；basisFunctions 使用相同的外层顺序。", "TableText"]}, {Cell["      ", "TableRowIcon"], "symminformation", Cell["对称操作", "TableText"], Cell["每条磁群记录都是 {label,R,t,\"F\"|\"T\"}；最后一个字段记录该操作是幺正还是反幺正。", "TableText"]}, {Cell["      ", "TableRowIcon"], "basisFunctions", Cell["局域轨道基底", "TableText"], Cell["每条 Wyckoff 轨道对应一个非空局域基列表。不同条目可以具有不同维数，从而产生矩形的轨道间 hopping 分块。", "TableText"]}}, GridBoxAlignment -> {"Columns" -> {{Left}}}, GridBoxDividers -> {"Rows" -> {{False}}}, GridBoxSpacings -> {"Columns" -> {Offset[0.27999999999999997], {Offset[0.7]}, Offset[0.27999999999999997]}, "Rows" -> {Offset[0.2], {Offset[0.4]}, Offset[0.2]}}]], "3ColumnTableMod"], Cell[BoxData["grapheneOperations = msgop[gray[191]];\ninit[\n  lattice -> {\n    {a, 0, 0},\n    {-a/2, Sqrt[3] a/2, 0},\n    {0, 0, c}\n  },\n  lattpar -> {a -> 1, c -> 3},\n  wyckoffposition -> {\n    {{1/3, 2/3, 0}, {0, 0, 0}}\n  },\n  symminformation -> grapheneOperations,\n  basisFunctions -> {{\"pz\"}}\n];"], "Input"], Cell["查看原子坐标和磁化方向", "Section"], Cell["初始化后，输入 atompos 就可以查看生成的原子坐标和磁化方向。结果按 Wyckoff 位置分组，每个原子写成 {分数坐标, 磁化方向}，两个向量都以晶格基矢为基：", "Text"], Cell[BoxData["atompos"], "Input"], Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{FractionBox["1", "3"], ",", FractionBox["2", "3"], ",", "0"}], "}"}], ",", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"0", ",", "0", ",", "0"}], "}"}]}], "}"}], ",", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{FractionBox["2", "3"], ",", FractionBox["1", "3"], ",", "0"}], "}"}], ",", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"0", ",", "0", ",", "0"}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}], "}"}], "}"}]], "Output"], Cell["结果中的两个原子位于 {1/3,2/3,0} 和 {2/3,1/3,0}。这里不考虑磁性，所以磁化方向都是 {0,0,0}。", "Text"], Cell["检查近邻键层", "Section"], Cell["跃迁按距离编号，1 表示 onsite 项，2 表示最近邻，3 表示第二近邻。对于石墨烯，showbonds[2] 画出三条最近邻碳碳键及其反向。查看这些键时还不需要给跃迁参数赋值。", "Text"], Cell[BoxData["showbonds[2]"], "Input"], Cell[BoxData[TagBox[GridBox[{{TemplateBox[{"\"Bond shell \"", "2", "\" (\"", "1", "\"-th neighbour), \"", "\"bond length = \"", "0.5773502691896257`", "\"; \"", "6", "\" directed bonds, \"", "1", "\" directed orbits\""}, "RowDefault"], "", "", ""}, {"\"Site index\"", "\"Atom position (fractional)\"", "\"Num. of directed bonds\"", TemplateBox[{TagBox[SubsuperscriptBox["p", "k", "'"], DisplayForm], "\" (fractional)\""}, "RowDefault"]}, {"1", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{FractionBox["1", "3"], ",", FractionBox["2", "3"], ",", "0"}], "}"}], "3", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{RowBox[{"-", FractionBox["1", "3"]}], ",", FractionBox["1", "3"], ",", "0"}], "}"}], ",", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{FractionBox["2", "3"], ",", FractionBox["1", "3"], ",", "0"}], "}"}], ",", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{FractionBox["2", "3"], ",", FractionBox["4", "3"], ",", "0"}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}, {"2", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{FractionBox["2", "3"], ",", FractionBox["1", "3"], ",", "0"}], "}"}], "3", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{FractionBox["1", "3"], ",", RowBox[{"-", FractionBox["1", "3"]}], ",", "0"}], "}"}], ",", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{FractionBox["1", "3"], ",", FractionBox["2", "3"], ",", "0"}], "}"}], ",", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{FractionBox["4", "3"], ",", FractionBox["2", "3"], ",", "0"}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}}, GridBoxAlignment -> {"Columns" -> {{Left}}}, AutoDelete -> False, GridBoxFrame -> {"Columns" -> {{True}}, "Rows" -> {{True}}}, GridBoxItemSize -> {"Columns" -> {{Automatic}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}], "Grid"]], "Output"], Cell["逐键层求解 Hamiltonian", "Section"], Cell["先用 symham[1] 求 onsite 项。两个碳原子是等价的，所以对角元含有相同的实参数 e1：", "Text"], Cell[BoxData["grapheneOnsite = symham[1];\nMatrixForm[grapheneOnsite]"], "Input"], Cell[BoxData[TagBox[RowBox[{"(", "⁠", GridBox[{{"e1", "0"}, {"0", "e1"}}, RowSpacings -> 1, ColumnSpacings -> 1, RowAlignments -> Baseline, ColumnAlignments -> Center], "⁠", ")"}], Function[BoxForm`e$, MatrixForm[BoxForm`e$]]]], "Output"], Cell["再用 symham[2] 求最近邻跃迁。右上角的三个相位因子来自三条最近邻键；t1 为实数时，左下角是它的复共轭：", "Text"], Cell[BoxData["grapheneNearest = symham[2];\nMatrixForm[grapheneNearest]"], "Input"], Cell[BoxData[TagBox[RowBox[{"(", "⁠", GridBox[{{"0", RowBox[{RowBox[{SuperscriptBox["", RowBox[{"", " ", RowBox[{"(", RowBox[{RowBox[{"-", FractionBox[RowBox[{"2", " ", "kx"}], "3"]}], "-", FractionBox["ky", "3"]}], ")"}]}]], " ", "t1"}], "+", RowBox[{SuperscriptBox["", RowBox[{"", " ", RowBox[{"(", RowBox[{FractionBox["kx", "3"], "-", FractionBox["ky", "3"]}], ")"}]}]], " ", "t1"}], "+", RowBox[{SuperscriptBox["", RowBox[{"", " ", RowBox[{"(", RowBox[{FractionBox["kx", "3"], "+", FractionBox[RowBox[{"2", " ", "ky"}], "3"]}], ")"}]}]], " ", "t1"}]}]}, {RowBox[{RowBox[{SuperscriptBox["", RowBox[{"", " ", RowBox[{"(", RowBox[{RowBox[{"-", FractionBox["kx", "3"]}], "-", FractionBox[RowBox[{"2", " ", "ky"}], "3"]}], ")"}]}]], " ", "t1"}], "+", RowBox[{SuperscriptBox["", RowBox[{"", " ", RowBox[{"(", RowBox[{RowBox[{"-", FractionBox["kx", "3"]}], "+", FractionBox["ky", "3"]}], ")"}]}]], " ", "t1"}], "+", RowBox[{SuperscriptBox["", RowBox[{"", " ", RowBox[{"(", RowBox[{FractionBox[RowBox[{"2", " ", "kx"}], "3"], "+", FractionBox["ky", "3"]}], ")"}]}]], " ", "t1"}]}], "0"}}, RowSpacings -> 1, ColumnSpacings -> 1, RowAlignments -> Baseline, ColumnAlignments -> Center], "⁠", ")"}], Function[BoxForm`e$, MatrixForm[BoxForm`e$]]]], "Output"], Cell["symham[3] 给出第二近邻跃迁。这些键连接同一子晶格上的碳原子，所以六个相位因子出现在对角元中：", "Text"], Cell[BoxData["grapheneNextNearest = symham[3];\nMatrixForm[grapheneNextNearest]"], "Input"], Cell[BoxData[TagBox[RowBox[{"(", "⁠", GridBox[{{RowBox[{RowBox[{SuperscriptBox["", RowBox[{RowBox[{"-", ""}], " ", "kx"}]], " ", "r1"}], "+", RowBox[{SuperscriptBox["", RowBox[{"", " ", "kx"}]], " ", "r1"}], "+", RowBox[{SuperscriptBox["", RowBox[{"", " ", RowBox[{"(", RowBox[{RowBox[{"-", "kx"}], "-", "ky"}], ")"}]}]], " ", "r1"}], "+", RowBox[{SuperscriptBox["", RowBox[{RowBox[{"-", ""}], " ", "ky"}]], " ", "r1"}], "+", RowBox[{SuperscriptBox["", RowBox[{"", " ", "ky"}]], " ", "r1"}], "+", RowBox[{SuperscriptBox["", RowBox[{"", " ", RowBox[{"(", RowBox[{"kx", "+", "ky"}], ")"}]}]], " ", "r1"}]}], "0"}, {"0", RowBox[{RowBox[{SuperscriptBox["", RowBox[{RowBox[{"-", ""}], " ", "kx"}]], " ", "r1"}], "+", RowBox[{SuperscriptBox["", RowBox[{"", " ", "kx"}]], " ", "r1"}], "+", RowBox[{SuperscriptBox["", RowBox[{"", " ", RowBox[{"(", RowBox[{RowBox[{"-", "kx"}], "-", "ky"}], ")"}]}]], " ", "r1"}], "+", RowBox[{SuperscriptBox["", RowBox[{RowBox[{"-", ""}], " ", "ky"}]], " ", "r1"}], "+", RowBox[{SuperscriptBox["", RowBox[{"", " ", "ky"}]], " ", "r1"}], "+", RowBox[{SuperscriptBox["", RowBox[{"", " ", RowBox[{"(", RowBox[{"kx", "+", "ky"}], ")"}]}]], " ", "r1"}]}]}}, RowSpacings -> 1, ColumnSpacings -> 1, RowAlignments -> Baseline, ColumnAlignments -> Center], "⁠", ")"}], Function[BoxForm`e$, MatrixForm[BoxForm`e$]]]], "Output"], Cell["把所需的项相加，就得到 Hamiltonian。这里保留 onsite、最近邻和第二近邻跃迁：", "Text"], Cell[BoxData["grapheneOnsite = symham[1];\ngrapheneNearest = symham[2];\ngrapheneNextNearest = symham[3];\ngrapheneHamiltonian =\n  grapheneOnsite + grapheneNearest + grapheneNextNearest;\nMatrixForm[\n  FullSimplify[\n    ExpToTrig[grapheneHamiltonian],\n    Element[{kx, ky, kz}, Reals]\n  ]\n]"], "Input"], Cell[BoxData[TagBox[RowBox[{"(", "⁠", GridBox[{{RowBox[{"e1", "+", RowBox[{"2", " ", "r1", " ", RowBox[{"(", RowBox[{RowBox[{"Cos", "[", "kx", "]"}], "+", RowBox[{"Cos", "[", "ky", "]"}], "+", RowBox[{"Cos", "[", RowBox[{"kx", "+", "ky"}], "]"}]}], ")"}]}]}], RowBox[{SuperscriptBox["", RowBox[{RowBox[{"-", FractionBox["1", "3"]}], " ", "", " ", RowBox[{"(", RowB